<Definition title="Quest Counter" section="States">
  <QuestCounter slot="preview" client:only="react" />

  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>The Guild Counter shows the quest progression list with per-quest status: REPORT (ready to turn in), LOCKED (prerequisite unmet), or CLEAR (already done).</p>

  <h2>Behavior</h2>
  <p>Selecting a quest shows its area, type, and reward. Locked quests stay greyed out until their parent quest is completed. Difficulty (Normal / Hard / Super-Hard) is chosen in a sub-menu after a quest is selected, not via top-level tabs.</p>

  <h2>Location</h2>
  <p>Guild Counter area, accessed by interacting with the Quest Counter NPC.</p>
</Definition>
